  DTS:Description="Nightly full warehouse load: extract -&gt; stage -&gt; quality -&gt; reference -&gt; dimensions -&gt; facts -&gt; aggregates -&gt; domain marts -&gt; publish. Supports resuming a failed batch from a named step and retries the two extract phases up to MaxExtractAttempts."
